OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start to a dry morning
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells. The afternoon
OL,7,Fstarting dry but cloud increasing,
OL,8,Fbringing rain to western parts by mid-
OL,9,Fafternoon and across to the east coast
OL,10,Fby evening, the rain becoming heavy in
OL,11,Fwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with further rain at
OL,14,Ftimes this evening and into the night
OL,15,Fsome heavy at times. Becoming drier
OL,16,Flater in the night with a few clear
OL,17,Fintervals.
OL,18,
OL,19,CFriday:
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
